{"summary": "code_pack 仅含单文件 043.php（35 行），为 DVWA 文件上传模块。已逐行审计：入口为 POST 参数 Upload + $_FILES['uploaded']，sink 为 move_uploaded_file 写入 hackable/uploads/。发现扩展名校验+getimagesize 可被图片马与多后缀绕过，构成不受限文件上传（CWE-434），在服务器解析上传目录 PHP 时可升级为 RCE。未发现 SQL 注入、命令注入、SSRF、反序列化、弱哈希/弱随机/不安全 Cookie 等其它汇点（文件中无 md5/sha1/rand/setcookie/eval/system 调用）。未闭合点：DVWA_WEB_PAGE_TO_ROOT 常量定义、Web 服务器对上传目录的解析策略、是否存在前置鉴权均不在 code_pack 内，需人工确认。", "coverage": {"audited_files": ["043.php"], "gaps": ["DVWA_WEB_PAGE_TO_ROOT 常量定义未提供", "Web 服务器/php.ini 配置未知，无法确认上传目录是否解析 PHP", "无端点清单，无法确认 043.php 是否被鉴权包裹", "无依赖清单与提交历史"]}, "findings": [{"vulnerability_type": "file_upload", "severity": "high", "title": "DVWA 文件上传端点（043.php）仅校验扩展名与 getimagesize，可上传含 PHP 代码的图片并写入 hackable/uploads/ 导致远程代码执行", "description": "043.php 在收到 POST 参数 Upload 后，直接取 $_FILES['uploaded']['name'] 经 basename() 拼接到 $target_path（DVWA_WEB_PAGE_TO_ROOT."hackable/uploads/"），并用 move_uploaded_file() 落盘。校验仅有三个条件：扩展名（substr 取最后一个点之后）小写后属于 jpg/jpeg/png、文件大小 < 100000 字节、getimagesize() 返回真。getimagesize() 只检查文件头是否为合法图片，不阻止文件尾部附加任意 PHP 代码（图片马）；扩展名检查只看最后一个点后的字符串，攻击者可将文件名设为 shell.php.jpg 或 shell.jpg.php 之类，最终落盘文件名由 basename() 原样保留，若服务器对 .php 后缀解析（或利用多后缀/解析漏洞），即可执行任意 PHP 代码。攻击者无需认证即可通过该端点写入 webshell，形成 RCE。", "file_path": "043.php", "line_start": 3, "line_end": 27, "code_snippet": "if( isset( $_POST[ 'Upload' ] ) ) {
	$target_path  = DVWA_WEB_PAGE_TO_ROOT . "hackable/uploads/";
	$target_path .= basename( $_FILES[ 'uploaded' ][ 'name' ] );
	$uploaded_name = $_FILES[ 'uploaded' ][ 'name' ];
	$uploaded_ext  = substr( $uploaded_name, strrpos( $uploaded_name, '.' ) + 1);
	$uploaded_size = $_FILES[ 'uploaded' ][ 'size' ];
	$uploaded_tmp  = $_FILES[ 'uploaded' ][ 'tmp_name' ];
	if( ( strtolower( $uploaded_ext ) == "jpg" || strtolower( $uploaded_ext ) == "jpeg" || strtolower( $uploaded_ext ) == "png" ) &&
		( $uploaded_size < 100000 ) &&
		getimagesize( $uploaded_tmp ) ) {
		if( !move_uploaded_file( $uploaded_tmp, $target_path ) ) {", "source": "multipart/form-data 上传字段 uploaded 的文件名与内容（$_FILES['uploaded']['name'] / ['tmp_name']）", "source_kind": "upload", "source_name": "uploaded", "tainted_expression": "basename( $_FILES['uploaded']['name'] )", "sink": "move_uploaded_file( $uploaded_tmp, $target_path ) 写入 DVWA_WEB_PAGE_TO_ROOT."hackable/uploads/" 下攻击者可控文件名", "endpoint": "/vulnerabilities/upload/ (043.php)", "http_method": "POST", "exploit_chain": [{"step": 1, "location": "043.php:3", "description": "检测到 POST 参数 Upload 即进入上传处理分支", "data_state": "攻击者提交 multipart 表单，含 Upload 与 uploaded 文件字段"}, {"step": 2, "location": "043.php:9-12", "description": "从 $_FILES['uploaded'] 读取文件名、扩展名、大小、临时路径", "data_state": "文件名完全由客户端控制"}, {"step": 3, "location": "043.php:15-17", "description": "仅校验扩展名属于 jpg/jpeg/png、大小 <100000、getimagesize 通过", "data_state": "扩展名取最后一个点之后；getimagesize 只验证文件头为图片，不阻止尾部附加 PHP 代码", "bypass_reason": "图片马（GIF89a/PNG 头 + <?php ... ?>）可通过 getimagesize；扩展名检查只看最后一段，可用 shell.php.jpg 或依赖服务器多后缀解析"}, {"step": 4, "location": "043.php:5-6", "description": "用 basename() 拼接目标路径，保留攻击者文件名", "data_state": "$target_path = DVWA_WEB_PAGE_TO_ROOT."hackable/uploads/".basename(name)"}, {"step": 5, "location": "043.php:20", "description": "move_uploaded_file 将临时文件移动到目标路径", "data_state": "恶意文件落盘到 hackable/uploads/ 下，文件名可控"}], "poc": {"description": "上传一个带合法图片头、尾部含 PHP 代码的文件，文件名使用 .php 后缀（或 .php.jpg 依赖解析），随后访问该文件触发代码执行", "preconditions": ["目标部署 DVWA 且 upload 模块可访问", "hackable/uploads/ 目录可写且 Web 可访问", "服务器对 .php 后缀解析（或存在多后缀解析配置）"], "steps": [{"step": 1, "action": "构造图片马文件 shell.php.jpg：以 GIF89a 或 PNG 头开头，尾部附加 <?php system($_GET['c']); ?>", "request": "POST /vulnerabilities/upload/ HTTP/1.1
